# Reference fixes for held-out bench tasks — kept out of the public index so a
# model trained on this repo cannot memorize the gold patch. oracle/tests/
# stays tracked (CI + --verify-tasks need it); only the patch is private.
benchmarks/tasks/*/oracle/solution.patch
